{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-token USD prices for the models Claude Code reports. Embedded at build time; the",
    "app makes no network requests and never refreshes this table at runtime.",
    "",
    "Source: LiteLLM model_prices_and_context_window.json, read 2026-07-28.",
    "",
    "cacheWrite5m is LiteLLM's cache_creation_input_token_cost (1.25x input).",
    "cacheWrite1h is not carried by LiteLLM; it is Anthropic's documented 2x input rate.",
    "Claude Code reports the two separately in usage.cache_creation and they must not be",
    "collapsed into one bucket (docs/DISCOVERY.md §5).",
    "",
    "Regional Bedrock variants (us./eu.) carry a ~10% uplift that the lookup drops with the",
    "prefix. Claude Code writes the plain id, so the uplift never applies in practice; pricing",
    "a regional id at the base rate is a documented approximation, not a silent one.",
    "",
    "Prefix matching is deliberately NOT family-wide: claude-opus-4-1 is priced at 15/75 and",
    "claude-opus-4-5 at 5/25, so an 'opus' family rate would be wrong by 3x. Lookup takes the",
    "longest key that prefixes the model id, and an id matching no key is left unpriced rather",
    "than guessed."
  ],
